    "detailed_description": "Oasis Blitz is a speedrunning 3D platformer focused around a unique movement mechanic: drilling into the ground. Play as Bandit, a drill-wielding fennec fox on a quest to reach the Oasis in the sky.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drill</h2>Use your drill to move fluidly through the environment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966980/extras/346e4692b13e4c9c556137b308da6142.poster.avif?t=1728947624\" width=436 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966980/extras/346e4692b13e4c9c556137b308da6142.webm?t=1728947624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966980/extras/346e4692b13e4c9c556137b308da6142.mp4?t=1728947624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Surf</h2>Surf down slopes on your sandboard to gain speed.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966980/extras/36ac44ab722e3661f657ede2891c0f3e.poster.avif?t=1728947624\" width=438 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966980/extras/36ac44ab722e3661f657ede2891c0f3e.webm?t=1728947624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966980/extras/36ac44ab722e3661f657ede2891c0f3e.mp4?t=1728947624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grapple</h2>Grapple to enemies, then smash through them with your drill!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966980/extras/49cdb5a6d9056436881d6a41c3362c22.poster.avif?t=1728947624\" width=438 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966980/extras/49cdb5a6d9056436881d6a41c3362c22.webm?t=1728947624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966980/extras/49cdb5a6d9056436881d6a41c3362c22.mp4?t=1728947624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the Desert</h2>Speed through racetrack inspired levels formed by floating desert islands.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966980/extras/f8adcdbbaea1a5dda4b0af2a9607cdd5.avif?t=1728947624\" width=640 height=360 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore your home</h2>Bring flowers back to your home, and chat with friends that you meet along the way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966980/extras/daec0590f79130aab9529f32167f698e.avif?t=1728947624\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966980/extras/9a39ab9a7ee7ef72f3e07c0aaa4000a3.avif?t=1728947624\" width=640 height=360 /></span>",
